<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_replication_analytics" kindref="compound">ReplicationAnalytics</ref></para>
<para>Tracks per-replica replication lag over time and surfaces insights (LAG_SPIKE, SLOW_REPLICA, NETWORK_ISSUE) with actionable recommendations. Also performs simple bottleneck classification. </para>
